    "description_html": "<p>A push-button ballpen made from sustainable bamboo with black trim and a chrome clip. An eco-friendly alternative to plastic promotional pens. It's part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/bamboo-pens/\">bamboo pen collection</a> at Custom Genie.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from sustainable bamboo with black trim and a chrome clip</li>\n<li>Eco-friendly alternative to plastic pens</li>\n<li>Large, full-color digital print area</li>\n<li>Digital print area: 60 x 6mm</li>\n<li>Writing ink color: Black</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Prefer a permanent laser-engraved 'burned' finish? See our <a href=\"../../../../pens/bamboo-ballpoint-pens-engraved/\">Engraved Bamboo Pens</a>.</p>\n<p>No setup fees. No design fees!</p>"
